   "source": [
    "# Full Production Simulation & Analysis Pipeline Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a **1-to-1 interactive mirror** of the production shell script [`scripts/run_full_production.sh`](../scripts/run_full_production.sh).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Pipeline Stages:\n",
    "1. **Environment Setup & 90% CPU Core Auto-Detection**: Dynamically allocates 90% system CPU capacity for parallel ASTRA simulations.\n",
    "2. **Phase 2 Unconstrained MOBO Campaign**: Multi-objective Bayesian Optimization using independent GP surrogates and $q\\text{LogNEHVI}$.\n",
    "3. **Phase 3 Constraint-Aware MOBO Campaign**: Multi-objective optimization weighted by explicit GP Probability of Feasibility surrogates.\n",
    "4. **Comparative Analysis & Hypervolume Progression**: Computes and plots non-dominated Pareto trade-offs and hypervolume growth.\n",
    "5. **Independent Pareto Candidate Rerun Audit**: Re-simulates 5 key candidates in fresh working directories to verify exact numerical reproducibility.\n",
    "6. **Engineering Tolerance Robustness Analysis**: Perturbation testing under $\\pm 0.1^\\circ$ RF phase and $\\pm 0.1\\%$ magnet field variations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import time\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "\n",
    "# Ensure mobo_linac src directory is in sys.path\n",
    "project_root = Path.cwd().parent if Path.cwd().name == \"notebooks\" else Path.cwd()\n",
    "if str(project_root / \"src\") not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.insert(0, str(project_root / \"src\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "from mobo_linac import __version__\n",
    "from mobo_linac.config import load_config\n",
    "from mobo_linac.execution.parallel import BatchEvaluator\n",
    "from mobo_linac.metrics.hypervolume import HypervolumeTracker\n",
    "from mobo_linac.plotting.pareto import plot_pareto_projections\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Calculate 90% available CPU cores\n",
    "num_workers = max(1, int(os.cpu_count() * 0.9))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. Output directory setup\n",
    "output_base = project_root / \"results\" / \"full_production_notebook\"\n",
    "p2_dir = output_base / \"phase2_unconstrained\"\n",
    "p3_dir = output_base / \"phase3_constrained\"\n",
    "analysis_dir = output_base / \"analysis\"\n",
    "for d in [p2_dir, p3_dir, analysis_dir]:\n",
    "    d.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"mobo_linac version: {__version__}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Allocated CPU Workers (90% capacity): {num_workers}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Base Output Directory: {output_base}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--- \n",
    "## Stage 1: Load Accelerator Physics Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "Loads centralized YAML configuration (`configs/mobo_200MeV.yaml`) containing 6D design bounds, physical objective targets, and beam constraint thresholds."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "config_path = project_root / \"configs\" / \"mobo_200MeV.yaml\"\n",
    "config = load_config(config_path)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Design Parameter Bounds:\")\n",
    "for var in config.design_variables:\n",
    "    print(f\"  - {var.name:25s}: [{var.lower_bound:8.4f}, {var.upper_bound:8.4f}] {var.unit}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nObjectives (Minimize):\")\n",
    "for obj in config.objectives:\n",
    "    print(f\"  - {obj.name:25s} ({obj.unit})\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nFixed Reporting Reference Point (Physical Space):\")\n",
    "print(f\"  {config.reporting_ref_point.tolist()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--- \n",
    "## Stage 2: Phase 2 Unconstrained MOBO Production Run\n",
    "\n",
    "Executes multi-objective optimization using independent GP surrogate models (`ModelListGP`) and $q\\text{LogNEHVI}$ acquisition functions across parallel worker pools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(f\"Executing Phase 2 MOBO campaign (Output: {p2_dir})...\")\n",
    "from scripts.run_validation_campaign import run_validation_campaign\n",
    "\n",
    "# Run Phase 2 campaign\n",
    "p2_results = run_validation_campaign(\n",
    "    config_path=config_path,\n",
    "    n_iterations=10,\n",
    "    batch_size=4,\n",
    "    num_workers=num_workers,\n",
    "    seed=42,\n",
    "    output_dir=p2_dir,\n",
    "    constrained=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"Phase 2 Campaign Complete.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--- \n",
    "## Stage 3: Phase 3 Constraint-Aware MOBO Production Run\n",
    "\n",
    "Executes constraint-aware MOBO using explicit GP surrogates for beam quality diagnostics to compute joint Probability of Feasibility."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(f\"Executing Phase 3 Constrained MOBO campaign (Output: {p3_dir})...\")\n",
    "\n",
    "p3_results = run_validation_campaign(\n",
    "    config_path=config_path,\n",
    "    n_iterations=10,\n",
    "    batch_size=4,\n",
    "    num_workers=num_workers,\n",
    "    seed=42,\n",
    "    output_dir=p3_dir,\n",
    "    constrained=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"Phase 3 Campaign Complete.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--- \n",
    "## Stage 4: Comparative Analysis & Hypervolume Progression\n",
    "\n",
    "Plots hypervolume progress and 2D Pareto front objective projections comparing Phase 2 and Phase 3."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "p2_hv_df = pd.read_csv(p2_dir / \"hypervolume.csv\")\n",
    "p3_hv_df = pd.read_csv(p3_dir / \"hypervolume.csv\")\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(p2_hv_df['iteration'], p2_hv_df['feasible_hypervolume'], 'o-', label='Phase 2 (Unconstrained)', color='#7f00ff', linewidth=2)\n",
    "ax.plot(p3_hv_df['iteration'], p3_hv_df['feasible_hypervolume'], 's-', label='Phase 3 (Constrained)', color='#00f2fe', linewidth=2)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('BO Iteration')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('Feasible Hypervolume (Normalized)')\n",
    "ax.set_title('Feasible Hypervolume Progress Comparison')\n",
    "ax.grid(True, linestyle='--', alpha=0.5)\n",
    "ax.legend(loc='lower right')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(analysis_dir / \"hypervolume_comparison_notebook.png\", dpi=300)\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--- \n",
    "## Stage 5: Independent Pareto Candidate Rerun Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "Selects 5 representative Pareto candidates (`min_emit_x`, `min_emit_y`, `min_sigma_energy`, `knee_point`, `balanced_feasible`) and re-runs them in clean isolated directories to verify exact numerical reproducibility."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from mobo_linac.verification.verifier import verify_pareto_candidates, export_verification_latex_table\n",
    "\n",
    "p3_pareto_df = pd.read_csv(p3_dir / \"pareto.csv\")\n",
    "verification_records = verify_pareto_candidates(\n",
    "    pareto_df=p3_pareto_df,\n",
    "    config=config,\n",
    "    workdir_base=analysis_dir / \"verification_reruns\",\n",
    "    num_workers=num_workers\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ver_df = pd.DataFrame(verification_records)\n",
    "print(\"Pareto Verification Rerun Summary:\")\n",
    "display(ver_df[['role', 'stored_emit_x_m_rad', 'rerun_emit_x_m_rad', 'max_rel_diff_pct', 'status']])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Export LaTeX table\n",
    "export_verification_latex_table(verification_records, analysis_dir / \"verification_table_notebook.tex\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "--- \n",
    "## Stage 6: Engineering Tolerance Robustness Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Evaluates Pareto candidate sensitivity under perturbed RF phase ($\pm 0.1^\\circ$) and magnet gradient ($\pm 0.1\\%$) engineering tolerances."
   ]
  },
